                  },
                  "\n  ",
                  {
                    "note": "\\note[item]{To build statistical models, we need a mathematical description of probability.}"
                  },
                  "\n  ",
                  {
                    "note": "\\note[item]{We need to take our intuition for what a system with uncertainty means, and encode it into a mathematical object.  that object will be what we call a probability space. }"
                  },
