                  },
                  "\n  ",
                  {
                    "note": "\\note[item]{Let's start with the sample space.  where do we get the sample space?  well we have to design it to represent the real world.  Let's give some examples.}"
                  },
                  "\n  Choosing sample space ",
                  {
